    },
    {
      "segment_id": "scene-01-beat-02",
      "scene_id": "scene-01",
      "beat_type": "contrast",
      "narration": "但能塞进一百万 Token，和能找到正确答案，是两回事。",
      "source_refs": ["insights.md Top 10 #1", "report.md §7.2"],
      "estimated_duration_range_ms": [3500, 5000],
      "pause_after_ms": 450
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "scene-02-beat-01",
      "scene_id": "scene-02",
      "beat_type": "problem",
      "narration": "想象把整个公司的资料库，一次性倒在模型桌上。",
      "source_refs": ["insights.md Top 10 #1"],
      "estimated_duration_range_ms": [3500, 5000],
      "pause_after_ms": 250
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "scene-02-beat-02",
      "scene_id": "scene-02",
      "beat_type": "problem",
      "narration": "桌子确实变大了，但成本、私有数据边界，还有到底该看哪一页，一个都没有自动消失。",
      "source_refs": ["insights.md Top 10 #1", "insights.md Most Misunderstood #5", "report.md §7.2"],
      "estimated_duration_range_ms": [7000, 9500],
      "pause_after_ms": 500
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "scene-03-beat-01",
      "scene_id": "scene-03",
      "beat_type": "discovery",
      "narration": "真正可能过时的，不是 RAG，而是把它理解成切块、向量搜索、取前几条的固定流水线。",
      "source_refs": ["insights.md Top 10 #1", "report.md §7.2"],
      "estimated_duration_range_ms": [7000, 9500],
      "pause_after_ms": 300
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "scene-03-beat-02",
      "scene_id": "scene-03",
      "beat_type": "discovery",
      "narration": "RAG 真正要做的，是在回答之前，先把外部信息选对。",
      "source_refs": ["insights.md Top 10 #1", "report.md §7.2"],
      "estimated_duration_range_ms": [4000, 5500],
      "pause_after_ms": 250
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "scene-03-beat-03",
      "scene_id": "scene-03",
      "beat_type": "transition",
      "narration": "长上下文，只是让切块没那么痛苦。",
      "source_refs": ["report.md §7.2"],
      "estimated_duration_range_ms": [2500, 4000],
      "pause_after_ms": 500
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "scene-04-beat-01",
      "scene_id": "scene-04",
      "beat_type": "evidence",
      "narration": "Anthropic 做过一个很简单的改动：给每个碎片补上五十到一百个 Token 的背景，再去建立索引。",
      "source_refs": ["report.md §4.5", "anthropic-contextual-retrieval.md"],
      "estimated_duration_range_ms": [8000, 10500],
      "pause_after_ms": 350
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "scene-04-beat-02",
      "scene_id": "scene-04",
      "beat_type": "evidence",
      "narration": "实验中，检索失败率下降了百分之四十九；加上重排序，下降到百分之六十七。",
      "source_refs": ["report.md §4.5", "anthropic-contextual-retrieval.md"],
      "estimated_duration_range_ms": [6500, 8500],
      "pause_after_ms": 500
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "scene-04-beat-03",
      "scene_id": "scene-04",
      "beat_type": "qualification",
      "narration": "当然，这个收益会随数据和系统变化，但方向很清楚：重点不是塞得更多，而是取得更准。",
      "source_refs": ["report.md §4.5", "report.md §7.1"],
      "estimated_duration_range_ms": [7000, 9500],
      "pause_after_ms": 550
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "scene-05-beat-01",
      "scene_id": "scene-05",
      "beat_type": "insight",
      "narration": "所以未来真正的问题，不是长上下文还是 RAG。",
